==Strategy==
[[Kagamine Rin & Len (Enemy)|Kagamine Rin & Len]] have the greatest range of the 3 bosses with a max range of 640, [[Megurine Luka (Enemy)|Megurine Luka]] hits to 500. So when attempting the later levels you'll want units with high range or the Long Distance ability E.g [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk]]. The best strategy is to stall the [[Kang Roo]] so that you can stack these LD units at the start.

